%% MediChain – Request Flow (Mermaid Sequence)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User as Patient/Doctor/Donor
  participant UI as Next.js App
  participant API as Node.js Backend
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant AI as Gemini
  participant Chain as Aptos Contracts

  User->>UI: Submit action (e.g., create fundraiser)
  UI->>API: POST /fundraisers (JWT)
  API->>DB: Validate & persist draft
  DB-->>API: OK
  API->>AI: Analyze/score (optional)
  AI-->>API: Insights
  API->>Chain: Create on-chain campaign (SC1)
  Chain-->>API: Tx hash / receipt
  API-->>UI: 201 Created + campaign + tx
  UI-->>User: Show verified on-chain fundraiser

